WEBVTT

00:27.470 --> 00:29.470
THAT TIME I GOT REINCARNATED AS A SLIME

01:41.500 --> 01:45.250
EPISODE 53: TWO SIDES MEETING

01:45.740 --> 01:47.250
Sorry for the wait.

01:47.250 --> 01:48.760
Let us begin.

01:50.880 --> 01:52.560
Whoa, whoa!

01:53.510 --> 01:56.220
That's all?
You came in late, you know?

01:56.220 --> 01:59.270
Not only have you failed
to prevent Veldora's resurrection,

01:59.640 --> 02:02.270
you even let a new Demon Lord be born.

02:02.270 --> 02:04.980
How can you show your face
here so brazenly like that?

02:08.400 --> 02:10.820
You're being rude, Sir Saare.

02:10.820 --> 02:12.000
He's right, boy.

02:12.000 --> 02:15.370
If you have an issue with our captain,
I'd be happy to work it out with you.

02:17.120 --> 02:21.500
You fancy-pants knights
wanna start a fight with us?

02:21.500 --> 02:23.120
What did you say?

02:23.120 --> 02:25.330
You seem to have a death wish.

02:25.330 --> 02:26.510
Enough foolishness.

02:27.630 --> 02:30.590
Now is not the time for us
to fight among ourselves.

02:33.670 --> 02:38.350
Saare, if you'd like to take my place,
I'd welcome you anytime.

02:38.730 --> 02:41.850
I'll need to test you out first, though.

02:43.060 --> 02:43.980
Tch.

02:44.810 --> 02:46.190
Reporting.

02:46.190 --> 02:48.730
The Great Forest of Jura
was in a state of peace.

02:49.150 --> 02:52.740
I also spotted several merchants
entering and exiting the area.

02:52.740 --> 02:56.110
Doing business with a Demon Lord?

02:56.110 --> 02:57.820
Veldora is a bigger concern.

02:57.820 --> 03:01.490
It doesn't seem like there's any sign of him
going on a rampage yet, though.

03:01.890 --> 03:04.460
Let us hear the report to the end.

03:04.810 --> 03:06.710
Very well.
I'll continue.

03:07.750 --> 03:11.710
The land of monsters is showing
tremendous growth.

03:12.210 --> 03:14.720
Their highway was maintained
in neat and clean order,

03:14.720 --> 03:16.720
and was safe to traverse.

03:17.180 --> 03:19.720
The magicule density in the area
was relatively high,

03:19.720 --> 03:22.720
but still below levels that would
harm average people.

03:22.720 --> 03:26.230
There were also no signs of any
emergence of Mystic Beasts.

03:26.640 --> 03:31.980
It appears to be true that the Demon Lord
Rimuru wishes to coexist with humanity.

03:31.980 --> 03:33.110
I see.

03:33.650 --> 03:35.700
And how about Veldora?

03:35.700 --> 03:38.240
Yes, as for that...

03:38.240 --> 03:41.530
Entry into the Sealed Cave was forbidden

03:42.080 --> 03:44.500
and I failed to spot his presence.

03:45.120 --> 03:45.910
Hm.

03:46.910 --> 03:48.500
That concludes my report.

03:48.500 --> 03:50.250
Thank you, Ritus.

03:51.840 --> 03:52.920
Which means...

03:53.330 --> 03:56.170
the news of his revival is likely a mista—

03:56.170 --> 03:57.840
Divine messages are never wrong.

03:58.680 --> 04:01.180
M-My apologies.

04:02.220 --> 04:03.640
Next report, please.

04:28.210 --> 04:32.630
And like that, Engrassia appears
to be as peaceful as it can be.

04:32.630 --> 04:36.340
If their rival Falmuth were to fall,

04:36.340 --> 04:40.260
I believe they would take the opportunity
to expand upon their current power.

04:42.090 --> 04:43.230
Thank you.

04:45.520 --> 04:47.420
My turn's next.

04:47.420 --> 04:49.520
And I'm guessing my report's
the clincher, huh?

04:49.910 --> 04:51.440
Yes, that's right.

04:51.440 --> 04:53.520
That is why I leave it to you.

04:53.950 --> 04:55.340
I see.

04:56.070 --> 04:58.400
The current state of Falmuth—

04:58.400 --> 05:01.330
Their king Edmaris abdicated the throne,

05:01.330 --> 05:04.420
and on the surface, the transfer of power
has taken place peacefully.

05:04.890 --> 05:06.040
But...

05:06.500 --> 05:11.540
It appears the new king Edward is busy
assembling talented mercenaries.

05:11.870 --> 05:14.250
They also started enlisting new soldiers.

05:14.250 --> 05:16.550
The nobles are getting frantic, too.

05:17.300 --> 05:20.950
It looked to me like
the signs of a looming civil war.

05:21.550 --> 05:25.100
But there is far too little
information to discern

05:25.100 --> 05:28.680
whether Demon Lord Rimuru
is involved in that or not.

05:29.060 --> 05:30.060
You're right.

05:30.600 --> 05:31.520
So?

05:31.930 --> 05:35.820
I went down the list of everyone
Edward made contact with.

05:35.820 --> 05:39.490
Important Council leaders,
Free Guild executives,

05:39.490 --> 05:41.860
and some merchants from the East.

05:41.860 --> 05:46.370
He even tried to make contact
with some of my men.

05:46.370 --> 05:49.120
Is he trying to shore up his military?

05:49.120 --> 05:52.000
Bingo. That's exactly it.

05:52.000 --> 05:53.960
It's settled, then.

05:53.960 --> 05:58.250
The new king Edward has no intention
in paying for the war reparations.

05:59.670 --> 06:02.880
And no Demon Lord
would let that slide.

06:02.880 --> 06:06.680
And I don't think Rimuru would be
foolish enough not to expect that.

06:07.130 --> 06:10.680
So do you think this is all part of
Demon Lord Rimuru's plans?

06:11.230 --> 06:12.440
Yeah.

06:13.310 --> 06:16.890
If only I listened to what he had to say,
then maybe...

06:18.650 --> 06:21.650
No, more importantly...

06:22.320 --> 06:25.910
So King Edward made contact
with the Eastern merchants?

06:25.910 --> 06:28.410
Did the merchants do
anything suspicious?

06:28.410 --> 06:30.050
Why do you care about the merchants?

06:30.050 --> 06:32.330
We should be talking about
Demon Lord Rimuru's plo—

06:32.330 --> 06:34.080
Just tell me.

06:36.380 --> 06:37.840
Grenda,

06:37.840 --> 06:41.800
did you hear anything in the commercial
zone about the Eastern merchants?

06:41.800 --> 06:46.800
Well, as far as I know,
there wasn't anything suspicious going on.

06:48.780 --> 06:53.930
But if our top wish to know more,
I'll give it a thorough look again.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.960
Please do.

06:55.960 --> 06:58.360
And don't let your guard down.

06:58.360 --> 07:00.780
Don't let them sway you
with their words.

07:01.440 --> 07:02.940
Sure thing.

07:02.940 --> 07:05.310
I'll go get some details.

07:07.490 --> 07:09.780
She's looking down on me.

07:10.280 --> 07:14.540
Now, I trust that everyone here
understands the current situation.

07:14.540 --> 07:15.850
Yes.

07:15.850 --> 07:20.130
The resurrection of the Storm Dragon
has had less of an impact than expected,

07:20.130 --> 07:24.300
and the only casualties so far
were the deployed Falmuth military.

07:24.820 --> 07:29.600
However, since this is likely
a cover story spread by Rimuru,

07:29.600 --> 07:32.310
the real number could be zero.

07:32.740 --> 07:37.730
If that's how it is, I want to hear from
Archbishop Reyhiem, who survived it.

07:37.730 --> 07:40.820
I'm curious about what
happened on the battlefield.

07:40.820 --> 07:43.230
I thought so too,
so I've already called for him.

07:43.230 --> 07:45.950
I believe he should arrive here soon.

07:46.330 --> 07:48.910
There were also rumors
that Demon Lord Rimuru

07:48.910 --> 07:51.490
managed to negotiate with Veldora
and calm him down.

07:51.490 --> 07:53.910
I'm not sure what to
make of that one, either.

07:53.910 --> 07:58.170
But it is a fact that he's been
revived and is now lying low.

07:58.170 --> 08:02.210
With that in mind,
the rumors sound believable.

08:04.010 --> 08:05.130
Right.

08:05.130 --> 08:07.270
That much is true.

08:07.270 --> 08:09.720
I've been meaning to tell you all this,

08:09.720 --> 08:12.050
but I received a message
from our lord Luminus.

08:15.080 --> 08:18.900
"The one who commands
the Storm Dragon Veldora is Rimuru."

08:18.900 --> 08:24.360
"Therefore, do not lay hands on
the Demon Lord Rimuru," she said.

08:24.860 --> 08:26.780
Bear that in mind.

08:26.780 --> 08:29.160
Y-You mean...

08:30.320 --> 08:32.280
I'll be blunt.

08:32.420 --> 08:37.420
We shall not face off
against the Demon Lord.

08:39.420 --> 08:41.110
What?!

08:41.110 --> 08:44.550
You want us to simply ignore all
the theatrics he's pulling over in Falmuth?!

08:44.550 --> 08:47.170
It's true that we aren't supposed
to mess with Demon Lords,

08:47.170 --> 08:49.470
but that's only on the surface!

08:49.470 --> 08:52.970
We, the Ten Great Saints,
are just as strong as the Demon Lords!

08:52.970 --> 08:57.220
But this time, not just a Demon Lord,
but the Storm Dragon is also involved!

08:57.220 --> 09:03.150
But we cannot let a Demon Lord do whatever
he pleases in the domain of humans!

09:07.150 --> 09:08.940
Our lord's messages are absolute.

09:08.940 --> 09:10.990
There is no defying them.

09:10.990 --> 09:14.950
Also, it doesn't mean
we will just let Falmuth be.

09:15.970 --> 09:19.210
What's happening in that nation
is nothing more than a civil war.

09:19.210 --> 09:22.330
What we need to protect is not
the royal family, but their people.

09:22.710 --> 09:25.800
Pay close attention to the situation,
so it won't affect

09:25.800 --> 09:28.050
the people of Falmuth or its neighbors.

09:28.410 --> 09:32.800
Then are we supposed to just sit here
and tolerate whatever Demon Lord Rimuru does?

09:33.170 --> 09:34.800
That's right.

09:34.800 --> 09:39.010
As Demon Lord Rimuru already declared,
he doesn't wish to make humanity his enemy,

09:39.010 --> 09:41.310
it's pointless to take
hostile action against him.

09:41.810 --> 09:45.150
Archbishop Reyhiem was part of
the subjugation team

09:45.150 --> 09:47.610
and I myself failed to eliminate Rimuru.

09:47.610 --> 09:51.490
As there is a high possibility
he already sees us as his enemy,

09:51.490 --> 09:54.450
we have no choice
but to overlook his actions.

09:54.450 --> 09:59.120
But those are the mistakes of
the Western Holy Church, and yourself!

09:59.120 --> 10:01.460
It is not the mistake of Lubelius!

10:01.830 --> 10:02.670
You're right.

10:03.210 --> 10:06.710
That is why I'm going to say
what I did was my own decision.

10:07.750 --> 10:09.050
Lady Hinata?!

10:16.930 --> 10:18.640
Calm down.

10:18.640 --> 10:22.390
I doubt he wants to
wage war with us as well.

10:22.390 --> 10:25.400
Can we really trust him that much?

10:25.780 --> 10:29.870
I know it's weird coming from me,
but I believe he can be trusted.

10:29.870 --> 10:32.400
It seemed he was trying
to avoid conflict as well.

10:32.810 --> 10:36.660
Furthermore, he's apparently
also an Otherworlder like me.

10:36.660 --> 10:39.660
Otherworlder?!
You got to be kidding me!

10:39.660 --> 10:44.120
He died in the other world
and got reincarnated here as a slime.

10:44.120 --> 10:46.650
I think he's telling the truth.

10:47.250 --> 10:51.420
Looking back, I feel kind of sorry
for what I did to him back then.

10:51.920 --> 10:53.380
What do you mean?

10:54.050 --> 10:56.390
I was being used, too.

10:56.390 --> 10:58.390
By the Eastern merchants.

10:58.390 --> 11:01.520
They told me that the monsters
were transforming into people

11:01.520 --> 11:04.390
to swindle their way
into other nations.

11:04.980 --> 11:09.900
And that Rimuru, that monster,
was the one who killed my master.

11:10.440 --> 11:13.820
That was why I immediately
decided to kill him.

11:14.820 --> 11:17.160
And you still let him get away?

11:17.160 --> 11:18.700
Yes.

11:18.700 --> 11:24.250
And it won't be wise to fight him again
now that he ascended to Demon Lord.

11:25.270 --> 11:29.040
But what if he sees you
as his enemy?

11:29.500 --> 11:32.550
It won't be strange
if he seeks revenge.

11:32.930 --> 11:36.760
Either way, I am planning
to talk things through with him.

11:36.760 --> 11:39.800
If needed, I won't hesitate
to give him my apology, too.

11:40.510 --> 11:42.140
- That's crazy!
- It's dangerous!

11:42.140 --> 11:45.140
He might lead you into
a trap to kill you!

11:45.140 --> 11:49.060
And even if he doesn't, what if his
legions of monsters were to attack you?

11:49.410 --> 11:51.110
Calm down.

11:51.110 --> 11:54.360
The first thing we need is to know
what Demon Lord Rimuru thinks.

11:57.400 --> 12:01.370
I doubt things will end up
as badly as everyone thinks.

12:01.990 --> 12:06.120
According to the reports,
Rimuru sounds like a friendly guy.

12:06.120 --> 12:09.120
That's also my impression of him
when I fought him.

12:09.710 --> 12:12.130
I know it's wrong for me
to hope for that now,

12:12.130 --> 12:15.630
but perhaps we can understand
each other once we actually talk.

12:17.720 --> 12:19.220
He's finally here.

12:19.220 --> 12:20.430
Come in.

12:30.100 --> 12:33.230
Archbishop of Falmuth, Reyhiem.

12:33.230 --> 12:36.240
I have come here in response
to your summons.

12:36.610 --> 12:40.820
Without further ado, Archbishop,
tell us about the Storm Drago—

12:54.040 --> 12:56.510
Good to see you again, Hinata.

12:56.910 --> 12:58.380
Are you in good health?

12:58.380 --> 13:01.510
What's wrong?
Why do you look so surprised?

13:04.390 --> 13:06.680
Why are you all here?

13:06.680 --> 13:09.350
Hinata, who are those guys?

13:09.710 --> 13:11.520
Mind your manners, Saare!

13:11.520 --> 13:13.900
You're in the presence of
the Seven Days Clergy!

13:14.310 --> 13:15.650
Seven Days Clergy?

13:15.650 --> 13:17.530
D-Did he say Seven Days Clergy?!

13:17.530 --> 13:18.740
The ones of legend?!

13:18.740 --> 13:21.820
The people said to raise Heroes?!

13:21.820 --> 13:24.030
Yes, exactly.

13:26.200 --> 13:27.680
That's right.

13:27.680 --> 13:31.210
The people that put me through
the Seven Days Trials.

13:31.210 --> 13:38.260
Though, I was able to Copy
their skills with my skill Usurper.

13:38.690 --> 13:42.300
But as the name implies,
I usurp their power,

13:42.300 --> 13:45.760
so they'd try to interfere with me
in any way they could.

13:46.760 --> 13:48.560
How bothersome.

13:48.560 --> 13:52.270
I really need to get this
meeting settled peacefully.

13:52.730 --> 13:56.020
So may I ask
what brings you here today?

13:57.360 --> 13:59.820
No need to be so alarmed.

13:59.820 --> 14:01.970
Archbishop Reyhiem here

14:01.970 --> 14:05.530
has brought back some information
about the Demon Lord Rimuru, has he not?

14:05.530 --> 14:08.290
We were interested in
hearing about it ourselves.

14:11.750 --> 14:15.540
I-I was a fool.

14:24.970 --> 14:26.100
We're dead!

14:26.100 --> 14:29.220
We're all going to die!

14:29.630 --> 14:31.930
Th-This can't be...

14:31.930 --> 14:34.600
What in the world is going on?!

14:41.740 --> 14:47.530
We challenged a foe that was fearsome,
far too fearsome for any of us.

14:47.900 --> 14:51.370
He is a Demon Lord,
beyond a shadow of a doubt.

14:51.370 --> 14:55.790
We have engineered the birth of
a new Demon Lord with our own hands!

15:01.380 --> 15:06.640
That sounds like the sunlight magic
Sir Gren's always so gifted at.

15:06.640 --> 15:09.720
Light-bending magic?

15:09.720 --> 15:13.980
But wouldn't an Anti-Magic Barrier
shut that down?

15:13.980 --> 15:17.810
And Gren's didn't have
that much force to it.

15:18.310 --> 15:20.650
It must be physics magic,
not regular magic.

15:20.650 --> 15:23.860
He must've concentrated sunlight
and reflected it to the enemies.

15:24.870 --> 15:28.820
Otherwise, the barrier
would've easily blocked it.

15:28.820 --> 15:32.450
He must've used his scientific knowledge
from the other world.

15:32.450 --> 15:37.250
If so, it'd be difficult for people here
to understand or deal with it.

15:37.250 --> 15:39.500
One moment.

15:39.500 --> 15:42.800
That light attack was a dreadful thing.

15:42.800 --> 15:45.260
But what's truly dreadful
was what happened after.

15:46.090 --> 15:51.220
The very next moment,
the battlefield goes into complete silence.

15:51.970 --> 15:53.350
What do you mean?

15:53.350 --> 15:56.780
I mean exactly what I said, Lady Hinata.

15:56.780 --> 16:03.610
At that moment, the surviving
twenty thousand men died.

16:03.610 --> 16:08.100
The only ones left were
Sir Razen, King Edmaris, and me.

16:12.160 --> 16:14.040
Catastrophe...

16:15.290 --> 16:17.580
That annoying evil dragon!

16:17.990 --> 16:22.340
He crushed everything
I built up all by himself.

16:23.710 --> 16:28.050
It won't be good for us if humanity,
a high-quality food, goes extinct,

16:28.050 --> 16:30.700
so I decided to protect them.

16:32.850 --> 16:35.970
Beings not even Lady Luminus can control.

16:35.970 --> 16:40.100
Those being Veldora
and the two Awakened Demon Lords.

16:41.020 --> 16:44.570
Guy Crimson the Lord of Darkness.

16:44.570 --> 16:47.360
And Milim Nava the Destroyer.

16:48.610 --> 16:49.810
I see.

16:49.810 --> 16:54.370
Then we should assume that
Demon Lord Rimuru has been awakened.

16:54.810 --> 16:56.620
I suppose we should.

16:57.160 --> 17:00.540
He has likely consumed a large
number of souls to awaken himself,

17:00.540 --> 17:03.500
like the two great Demon Lords
in the legend.

17:04.040 --> 17:05.190
Now what?

17:05.190 --> 17:09.010
If we leave him be, he'll become a threat
beyond anything we can handle, won't he?

17:09.010 --> 17:10.840
Calm down!

17:10.840 --> 17:14.840
If Rimuru is a former human
and wishes to coexist with humanity,

17:14.840 --> 17:16.840
there's no need to force
a fight with him!

17:16.840 --> 17:18.270
Right.

17:18.270 --> 17:20.360
We need to see how he acts first.

17:20.360 --> 17:24.980
But if it is a fact that he mowed down
twenty-thousand knights without hesitation,

17:24.980 --> 17:26.730
he is clearly a threat.

17:26.730 --> 17:30.360
Is it really okay for us
to simply believe in him?

17:30.360 --> 17:33.740
I have a plan regarding that,

17:33.740 --> 17:36.200
so I want the rest of you
to continue to gather info—

17:36.200 --> 17:40.290
Reyhiem, do you have
any other messages for us?

17:40.290 --> 17:42.370
I-I actually do have this.

17:47.880 --> 17:51.880
It's said to be a message from
Demon Lord Rimuru to you, Lady Hinata.

17:52.430 --> 17:53.530
For me?

17:59.770 --> 18:01.640
I'll take you on.

18:01.640 --> 18:03.730
You and me, one-on-one.

18:07.320 --> 18:09.900
Wh-What should we do, Lady Hinata?

18:09.900 --> 18:12.450
Lady Hinata, let me do this!

18:12.450 --> 18:15.070
I will gladly crush
this Demon Lord's ambitions!

18:15.070 --> 18:18.440
Come on, I know you're good
with your sword and all,

18:18.440 --> 18:20.710
but don't you think your brain
could use some work?

18:20.710 --> 18:21.790
What did you say?!

18:21.790 --> 18:24.870
Hinata just said we should
keep our hands off him.

18:24.870 --> 18:28.050
If we do anything, the other Demon Lords
aren't just gonna let it slide.

18:28.050 --> 18:33.720
Plus, if he's fully awakened,
I think we should accept his request.

18:33.720 --> 18:35.340
He's right, Arnaud.

18:35.340 --> 18:37.720
He also has the Storm Dragon on his side.

18:38.070 --> 18:40.140
If you were to bring a troop with you,

18:40.140 --> 18:43.730
it could escalate to dragging the other
Western Nations into a great war.

18:44.770 --> 18:46.980
How should I take this...?

18:47.410 --> 18:51.990
Since he's done with Clayman,
now's simply my turn?

18:53.200 --> 18:54.540
It's odd.

18:54.540 --> 18:57.170
Why would he want to have
his revenge now, of all times?

18:57.640 --> 19:04.030
Plus, why does Arze know that
Reyhiem has a message from Rimuru?

19:05.540 --> 19:09.630
Either way, since he's calling me out,
I'll have to go meet him myself.

19:09.630 --> 19:10.640
It's dangerous!

19:10.640 --> 19:12.850
Now that it's clear that
he has malice towards you,

19:12.850 --> 19:14.880
there is no need for you
to come out yourself!

19:16.590 --> 19:18.600
Wonderful decision.

19:18.600 --> 19:22.270
May the protection of
the god Luminus safeguard you.

19:22.270 --> 19:24.980
The Demon Lord Rimuru is a threat, yes.

19:24.980 --> 19:28.560
But even if your talks turn sour,
there is nothing to be concerned about.

19:28.560 --> 19:31.320
We're sure you can defeat him.

19:31.770 --> 19:35.200
But, Hinata, you are forgetting something.

19:35.200 --> 19:38.410
Indeed.
The presence of that dragon...

19:38.410 --> 19:41.950
I fear not even you could
defeat such a menace!

19:43.950 --> 19:46.540
Do not overestimate your strength, Hinata.

19:46.540 --> 19:51.290
No attack would ever faze that dragon.

20:00.220 --> 20:03.600
But rest assured, Hinata.

20:03.600 --> 20:06.230
We will leave you with this.

20:06.730 --> 20:09.730
It is called the Dragonbuster!

20:12.590 --> 20:15.490
Good grief, can they be
any more shameless about it?

20:15.970 --> 20:18.570
Their goal is to make me
take down Veldora.

20:19.100 --> 20:22.740
And if we killed each other while at it,
the better it is for them.

20:25.650 --> 20:28.360
I will gladly accept it.

20:29.000 --> 20:32.040
We trust you handle it well.

20:32.040 --> 20:34.750
I hope things go well for you.

20:34.750 --> 20:40.970
If worse comes to worst,
that sword shall protect you.

20:52.480 --> 20:55.390
Are you really leaving?

20:55.390 --> 20:59.110
Yes. That is my responsibility.

20:59.510 --> 21:02.200
Is there any way to convince you not to?

21:02.200 --> 21:03.490
Enough.

21:03.490 --> 21:07.750
Stop worrying. It's not like
it's guaranteed to be a fight.

21:11.250 --> 21:13.820
It'll work out fine, Nicolaus.
Like it always does.

21:14.380 --> 21:15.980
There's nothing to worry about.

21:18.670 --> 21:23.220
We'll need to prepare the highway
to Thalion, hold the festival, and...

21:24.350 --> 21:25.220
Hm?

21:25.220 --> 21:29.140
Great Rimuru,
Hinata Sakaguchi is heading this way.

21:29.140 --> 21:30.270
What?!

21:30.630 --> 21:32.770
She's coming all by herself?
Really?

21:32.770 --> 21:36.610
Yes, she's the only one
coming out from Engrassia.

21:37.320 --> 21:38.240
What happened?

21:38.570 --> 21:42.490
Four Paladins are on the move,
appearing to be following after Hinata.

21:42.870 --> 21:44.910
Just four?

21:44.910 --> 21:47.620
Do you think Hinata is coming to fight us?

21:47.620 --> 21:49.330
I don't know.

21:49.330 --> 21:54.670
But since she's carrying a large sword,
I doubt she is coming on friendly terms.

21:54.670 --> 21:56.290
Really?!

21:56.800 --> 21:58.670
Looks like she's serious.

21:58.670 --> 22:01.630
Was my message all for nothing?

22:01.630 --> 22:03.340
Thanks for the report, Soka.

22:03.340 --> 22:05.140
Keep an eye on the situation.

22:05.140 --> 22:05.970
Yes, sir!

22:08.470 --> 22:09.810
Great Rimuru.

22:09.810 --> 22:11.060
I have a report.

22:11.060 --> 22:14.020
What's wrong? It's not often
you look so serious.

22:14.020 --> 22:15.060
What happened?

22:15.770 --> 22:18.570
Reyhiem is dead.

22:18.570 --> 22:22.240
What? Like, not from illness or anything?

22:22.240 --> 22:23.530
Yes.

22:23.530 --> 22:27.740
The cause is unknown, but he was
very likely killed by someone.

22:28.240 --> 22:32.040
After all your concern about him
being silenced...

22:32.040 --> 22:34.250
This was my fault.

22:34.250 --> 22:38.000
I-It's fine.
It was just an offhand comment.

22:38.000 --> 22:40.260
I didn't think it'd actually happen.

22:40.880 --> 22:43.680
At the same time,
around Falmuth's neighboring nations,

22:43.680 --> 22:47.300
there are rumors spreading
about how the archbishop

22:47.300 --> 22:49.510
was killed under the scheme of a demon.

22:49.510 --> 22:51.890
And the Temple Knights
from all over the nations

22:51.890 --> 22:54.890
have been seemingly
deployed in response.

22:54.890 --> 23:00.030
I believe they will join the forces
of King Edward in a few days.

23:00.570 --> 23:04.740
This commotion...
Why now?

24:36.620 --> 24:39.330
Next time, "Approaching Threats."
